Outputx is positiveNested Ternary Condition: A nested ternary condition is a ternary operator placed inside another ternary operator. It is used when you need to check multiple conditions in a single line. The    inner ternary executes only if required by the outer condition.Flowchart of Nested Ternary Condition 
